      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu aIsarela, bayi muzaŋalala nakuluŋa neyi chaluŋaŋa nyuzaku; muloŋa eyi washiya dehi Nzambi yeyi, hiwukuya nakwila wuvumbi, wunakeŋi kufwetela ayivumbi hamawuhulilu atidiku ejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela kuwuhulilu hela kuwukamwinu wavinyu hiyakamona chakuyidiishaku, nivinyu yayiha hakayimonaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakashakama mwituŋa daYehovaku; ilaŋa Efweremi wakafunta cheŋi kuEjipitu, akadya yakudya yamajilu kuAshuri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakamu mwaŋila Yehova nyilambu yavinyuku, yumoyu hiyakamutiyishaŋa kuwahaku. Yimuna yawu yakaketulaŋawu kudi wena yakekala neyi yakudya yadyaloŋawu akwakudila akwawu; antu ejima akayidya akajilola; muloŋa yakudya yawu akayidiila nzala hohu; hiyakashika mwitala daYehovaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hefuku dachawija chakushiika, nihefuku dachawija chaYehova, mwakela ŋahi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa tiyenu, anatemuki dehi kujilumuka, hela chochu, akayikuŋula kudi aEjipitu, akayijiika kudi akwaMemifwisi. Yuma yawu yayiwahi yasiliva yakekala yambala yatunyuŋi; mumatenti awu mwakamena nyiŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mafuku akuyibabesha anashiki dehi, mafuku akufuta nyiloŋa anashiki dehi. AIsarela akahosha nawu, Kaprofwetu hichisupi, muntu wukweti spiritu wazaluka; nakuluwaluwa kweyi kunavuli, nawulumbu wunasweji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efweremi wadiŋi mukwakutalatala hamu naNzambi yami; hakwila kaprofwetu, kunjila jindi jejima kudi nyihetu yawakwakujaha tujila, mwitala daNzambi yindi mudi wulumbu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anaditokeshi chakunama neyi chaditokesheluwu kuGibeya. Wakaanuka kuluwa kwawu; wakayibabesha nanshidi jawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami naweni aIsarela neyi nyikabu yanyivinyu yamwisaŋa; ankakulula jenu nayimweni neyi nyikabu yatachi yachikuyu hachila aka chindi chakusambila. Ilaŋa wena ayili kuBayali Peyori, adijilikilili chuma chansonyi, abalumukili kwikala ayishimashima neyi chumochu chakeŋeluwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila aEfweremi, kulema kwawu kwakayituuka neyi kajila; hikwakekala kuvwala, hela kwikala nevumu, hela kwimitaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela akalela anyanawu, nakayijaha kulonda niyibondi, hikwakashala muntu niwumuku; mwalala chinakafuma kudi wena, yayo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efweremi anamutumba kwakuwahi, neyi chinamoni Tira; hela chochu, Efweremi wakedisha anyanindi kudi mukwakujaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Yehova, yinki. Wukuyinkadi? Yinki mavumu alufwisha, nimayeli ominina chau.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutama kwawu kwejima kudi muGiligali, kwenoku diku natachikilili kuyihela. Nakayihaŋa mwitala dami, muloŋa wakutama kwyuma yelaŋawu; hinakayikeŋa nawa cheŋuku; atulamba twawu ejima hiyakwakutomboka hohu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efweremi anamweti, muji wawu woma dehi, hiyakasoŋa nawa cheŋi nyikabuku. Mwalala, hela neyi akavwala, nakajaha anyana akumavumu awu akeŋewa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi yami wakayinata, nanochu chabuliluwu kutiyilila kudi yena. Akekala akwakutambatamba munyuza yawantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
